        <mxCell id="IV5S1NsOqQvO_kucHN3K-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="42" width="778" x="3511" y="10072" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Student\n\n    participant CatalogPage\n    participant CourseHook\n    participant APIClient\n    participant CatalogController\n    participant AuthMiddleware\n    participant CourseService\n    database DB\n\n    note over CatalogPage,DB: Phase 1 — Course Catalog Browsing\n\n    Student -&gt;&gt; CatalogPage: 1. Navigate to course catalog\n\n    activate CatalogPage\n\n    CatalogPage -&gt;&gt; CourseHook: 2. fetchCourses(filters)\n\n    activate CourseHook\n\n    CourseHook -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 3. GET courses\n\n    activate APIClient\n\n    APIClient -&gt;&gt; CatalogController: 4. GET /api/catalog\n\n    activate CatalogController\n\n    CatalogController -&gt;&gt; AuthMiddleware: 5. authenticate()\n\n    activate AuthMiddleware\n\n    AuthMiddleware -&gt;&gt; DB: 6. Validate user\n\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt;&gt; AuthMiddleware: User valid\n    deactivate DB\n\n    AuthMiddleware --&gt;&gt; CatalogController: Authorized\n\n    deactivate AuthMiddleware\n\n    CatalogController -&gt;&gt; CourseService: 7. getPublishedCourses()\n\n    activate CourseService\n\n    CourseService -&gt;&gt; DB: 8. Find published courses\n\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt;&gt; CourseService: Courses data\n    deactivate DB\n\n    CourseService --&gt;&gt; CatalogController: Published courses\n\n    deactivate CourseService\n\n    CatalogController --&gt;&gt; APIClient: 9. 200 OK\n\n    deactivate CatalogController\n\n    APIClient --&gt;&gt; CourseHook: 10. onSuccess(courses)\n\n    deactivate APIClient\n\n    CourseHook --&gt;&gt; CatalogPage: 11. Update state\n\n    deactivate CourseHook\n\n    CatalogPage -&gt;&gt; Student: 12. Display course catalog\n\n    note over CatalogPage,DB: Phase 2 — Course Details\n\n    Student -&gt;&gt; CatalogPage: 13. Select course\n\n    CatalogPage -&gt;&gt; CourseHook: 14. fetchCourseDetails(courseId)\n\n    activate CourseHook\n\n    CourseHook -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 15. GET course details\n\n    activate APIClient\n\n    APIClient -&gt;&gt; CatalogController: 16. GET /api/catalog/:courseId\n\n    activate CatalogController\n\n    CatalogController -&gt;&gt; CourseService: 17. getCourseDetails()\n\n    activate CourseService\n\n    CourseService -&gt;&gt; DB: 18. Find course details\n\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt;&gt; CourseService: Course + Instructor + Chapters\n    deactivate DB\n\n    CourseService --&gt;&gt; CatalogController: Course details\n\n    deactivate CourseService\n\n    CatalogController --&gt;&gt; APIClient: 19. 200 OK\n\n    deactivate CatalogController\n\n    APIClient --&gt;&gt; CourseHook: 20. onSuccess(details)\n\n    deactivate APIClient\n\n    CourseHook --&gt;&gt; CatalogPage: 21. Update state\n\n    deactivate CourseHook\n\n    CatalogPage -&gt;&gt; Student: 22. Display course details\n    Note right of CatalogPage: Syllabus, instructor, reviews, price\n\n    deactivate CatalogPage&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="IV5S1NsOqQvO_kucHN3K-2">
